@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Webhook with a wrong hash (expect 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flutterwave/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
verif-hash: wrong

{ "event": "charge.completed", "data": { "tx_ref": "kw-example" } }

### Payment status for an unknown reference (expect confirmed:false)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/donations/status/kw-example
